## Third-Party Collaboration Notice — AMD-Instinct Labs

This repository references and builds upon hardware benchmark data produced
by the AMD-Instinct Labs project (`fa_dme`, `fa_robust.hip`,
`probe_mfma_mapping.hip`) on AMD MI300X hardware. That code and data are
owned by their respective authors and are **not** covered by this license.

**Scope of this license with respect to AMD collaboration:**

- The L4 analysis code that *consumes* AMD-provided benchmark data is
  covered by AGPL-3.0 (Part 2 above).
- The AMD-Instinct benchmark infrastructure itself is governed by its own
  license, available in the AMD-Instinct repository.
- Results derived from AMD hardware measurements and incorporated into L4
  papers will credit AMD-Instinct Labs as contributors per the inter-project
  collaboration agreement documented in the CAL collaboration wiki.

