## Intellectual Property Notice

The **L4 Efficiency Hypothesis**, the **Representational Convergence
Conjecture (RCC)**, and the **Meta-Inference Layer (L4)** theoretical
framework were conceived and formalized by Juan Pablo Chancay as part of
the CAL research program.

This repository serves as a timestamped public record of the original
contribution, establishing intellectual priority prior to formal academic
publication.

- CAL pre-paper: DOI 10.5281/zenodo.20430343 (May 2026)
- Repository: <https://github.com/jpcpol/Meta-Inference-Layer-L4>

